WEBVTT

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.070
I already knew about it...

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:46.030
But I didn't think he was this far from becoming a real man.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.190
Hoshimura...

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:50.370
Makina...

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.750
Good morning, Bro.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:01:59.960
Hey!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.080
What are you doing?!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.340
Well...

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.580
I was just checking on how you were doing.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.300
You're doing great!

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.010
What the hell is this?!

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.410
It's the proof of my love for you.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:19.440
Look at all of these Moe Senshi goods and figurines!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.450
There's more.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.830
I've even given you many items that are sold out nowadays!

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:28.110
This is me, that wants his little brother to be happy.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:30.320
Why don't you decorate your own room with them!?

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:31.440
Go home already!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.080
Do you want to be alone already?

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:40.040
You want to have fun with all these ladies alone, huh?

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.490
Like hell I would!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.060
Hey, Oori...

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.410
What is it?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.980
Is anything bothering you lately?

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:52.860
No, there isn't.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.850
I should be the one asking that.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:00.100
You were badly wounded the other day.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.520
You said you fell during some exercises but...

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:06.800
I'll be careful.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.310
You should be careful too.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:09.970
Eh?

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.580
You shouldn't get too exited.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.240
Don't ever show up again!

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:15.700
Perverted bastard.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.200
See you later!
Perverted bastard.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:16.820
See you later!

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.180
Not again.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.190
You weren't listening to my song.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:48.990
I was listening.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.480
But I've got to work.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.360
My song is much more important then your job.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.700
Don't forget that.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.620
Aren't you happy that you can listen to my song instead of going to work?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.710
Of course I am happy.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:12.590
There's no one that doesn't cry from happiness after listening to your songs, Kun-chan.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.400
That's right, isn't it.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.650
I got your phone call!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.590
Isn't it Kenaika?

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.070
There are a lot of women that work until they die.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:35.320
But those who still bring in the big bucks after death are pretty rare.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.840
But can you bring her up in front a crowd?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.840
She says she wants to sing no matter what.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.860
Not unlike that time in Tokyo.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.350
You can count on us if something is wrong.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.040
Yes.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.250
Yes?

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.040
Who is this?!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.210
What did you say about Kun?

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:57.820
Just be careful.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.370
They're after you.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:00.680
What are you talking about?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.130
Are you a stalker?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.900
Shikabane Hime.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.760
One that slaughters Corpses.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.330
Shikabane Hime?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.020
What is a Shikabane Hime?

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.450
And who the hell are y—?

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.760
Are these all of them?

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:29.870
Yes.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.250
These are all the volumes from ten years ago.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.760
Ouch! Ouch!

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.010
Hey you.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:42.170
Who allowed your lazy ass in my library?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.170
This isn't your library!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.890
The school library is the school representative's property.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.520
What are you looking up?

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:53.180
I heard that the house of a certain Hoshimura family burned down a long time ago.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:53.930
A fire?

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.890
Things like that don't always end up in the newspapers.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.810
I know that, but...

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.380
"If you want to die"~

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.460
Kun-chan is the greatest!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.000
He disgusts me.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:08.220
Oori!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.180
You're coming to the free concert today, right?

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.930
Oh, that's right.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.570
It's your day off right?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.080
It's Kun-chan in person!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.100
Kun-chan in person!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.540
She's very hot right now.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.470
And even...

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.730
I think I'll pass.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.730
I guess I'll go alone then.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.190
"Corpses are filled with nothing else"~

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.640
What?

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.250
I know why you're looking that up.

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:36.860
It has to do with a girl right?

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:38.570
Why?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.770
Am I mistaken?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.570
Why else would you look something up about a fire?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.250
That's because...

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.870
Something bothered me about this.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.380
About the Hoshimuras.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:58.590
Yes.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:06:59.690
Yes.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.390
Hoshimura?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.050
I'm going out for a while.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:09.960
It was that day...

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:14.440
...that my brother started coming home wounded.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.080
Disgusting.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.870
What's this all of the sudden?

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.000
All of your perverted anime figures and posters are gone.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.430
I moved all of them to a safe place.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.770
Because you were about to throw them away the other day.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.440
Do you think I can talk about work with you after seeing those?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.120
What's this?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.200
Osaki Kun.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.460
She released her second album earlier this week.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.120
But...

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.280
She is already dead.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.750
I've heard that she had health problems for a while.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.570
Then earlier this year she collapsed,

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.960
and took some time of work saying that she had problems at home.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.960
But in reality, she had heart problems.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.180
Wouldn't the hospitals have said something already?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.580
Some people within the actors bureau are connected to the mafia.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.200
Anyhow...

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.850
Her manager must be connected with them.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.440
Is her manager hiding the fact that she is a Corpse?

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.470
Together with her comeback, several people have gone missing.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:38.710
Her new manager, a part time jobber at the television station, the handyman from her mansion.

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:43.660
She hasn't been on TV or had any concerts since the launch of her new album.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:46.580
They are hiding the fact that she died.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:51.240
But now she is going to hold a concert in the neighborhood.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:53.810
If we are able to get to her,

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.640
we should be able to dispose of her somehow.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.170
First we must make sure of her true identity.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.170
Excuse me.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.190
I've been called by Osaki Kun's manager's office.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.890
They're renting the locked room on the fifth floor.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.200
It seems to be very crowded there.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:24.820
Okay.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.830
Why is it crowded?

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:46.990
Is it you who ordered this pizza?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.240
What did you do?

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.500
With such a distance?

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.020
Are you the one that tried to touch our merchandise?

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.740
Look at her cute face.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.640
Stand back!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.780
Stand back now!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.800
How did you know I was coming?

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.250
That because they called me.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.380
What does it matter?

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.630
Did you come to listen to my song too?

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.460
You died.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:26.430
Yes.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.760
But I want to sing.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.470
That's why I didn't die.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:31.800
You did die.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:32.520
And now...

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.140
Now!

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.220
Don't act recklessly.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.900
You're the one that brought that girl right?

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:55.250
Don't accuse me.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.880
I do blow my nose!

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.020
You're Hankami!

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:04.620
It's Kagami! Kagami!

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.400
Hanakami, Hanakami!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.320
Everyone stop already.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.520
You're bothering Oori-niichan.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:12.470
Damn.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.600
No fun at all.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.310
Did you find out anything?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:21.270
I believe that the Hoshimuras were connected to Keisei's temple.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.190
From the Kougon cult?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:27.690
She came over to say hello shortly after her father died.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.700
I believe he was Keisei's sempai.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.690
But I never heard about their house being burned down.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.030
Do you have an address?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.170
Why don't you ask Keisei?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.400
You're right, but...

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.050
Is this...?

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:45.900
Hey!

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:51.740
Keisei?

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.040
I see her!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:54.950
She's alive?!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:55.920
She's a monster!

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:01.490
Wait!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.380
Get her!

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:16.790
Watch him closely.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.770
I'm sorry about this.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:19.900
Please ask my father...

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:20.820
No.

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:23.310
Please ask sir Tagami to report this.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.430
Report it?

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.250
Of course the police knows nothing about Corpses.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.590
But if it's up to armed Yakuza's, they can handle it.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:32.840
Understood.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.210
I'm sorry.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:37.360
Don't worry about it.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.390
I'm backing up the girl.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.450
It's our mission.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:46.690
But I can imagine how much pain you're in, after hurting a normal human being.

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:48.120
I try to understand.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.540
Hey, hey, hey!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.260
Something big is happening!

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:03.850
Ushi?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.220
At the concert!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.310
I told you it starts at ten!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.650
It seems to be some problem between Yakuza gangs.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.920
They say they attacked Kun-chan.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.270
With a gun!

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.290
Kun-chan you say?

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.860
Some people are saying the attacker was a girl.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.830
It's very crowded around the concert hall.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.410
Anyway it must be over for Kun-chan.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.100
I'll call you again later.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.820
Hosimura Makina?

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:49.850
You read it.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:52.430
It's the truth.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.820
It's the grave of my family, including mine.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:57.900
But you are?

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:00.490
We were murdered.

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.070
And they've even burned down the temple.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:05.550
But I got resurrected.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.340
As Shikabane Hime.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.980
If you found out everything you wanted to know now,

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.090
never appear in front of me again.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:14.670
Why?

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:15.640
Why?

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.800
I want to get to know you.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.400
We are the dead.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:23.270
We have been hurt.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.190
The living shouldn't be allowed to get near us.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.080
If you get any closer...

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:31.770
Yes?

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.380
Are you alright?

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:34.990
How is it?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.130
I'm fine.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.930
I'm hunting it down.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.570
Aren't you hurt?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.170
Who are you talking to?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:43.840
Don't come near.

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:45.030
Okay?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.750
I wanted to run away through town.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.810
But before I noticed I stranded here.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.770
I used to play hide and seek here when I was a kid.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.730
I got yelled at quite often for it.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:01.730
Hoshimura-san?

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.590
Was that a friend on the phone earlier?

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.190
He was right you know.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.430
I was after Osaki Kun.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.230
Is Osaki Kun a Corpse?

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:22.010
What should I do?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.520
I tried to murder an idol.

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:28.570
The police and even the Yakuza should be after me.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:29.950
But...

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.360
I can't leave you alone here.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.870
My brother adopted me when I was three.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.660
My brother told me that he just couldn't let me be.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.130
We don't have the same blood.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.500
But maybe we're alike somehow.

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:20.840
The police have come to the bureau already.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:21.860
I want to sing.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:22.840
I want to sing.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:23.850
I want to sing.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.160
Of course you will sing.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.390
They're just looking for the people you killed.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.850
I killed no one!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:31.290
You're right, Kun.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:34.160
They stopped me from singing.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.330
They stopped me.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:37.850
They stopped me.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.850
They stopped me!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:43.680
Kun-chan!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.650
What a horrible song.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.490
You can sing that song alone in hell.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.540
You're just a bother for the living.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.980
How rude!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.670
What do you think?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.310
Isn't Kun a strong girl?

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.740
Are you okay after seeing such a monster?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:42.090
Something like that is able to get to the top of this world!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:48.670
What should we do?

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.440
Get out of the building at once.

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:52.930
I'll be alright.

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:54.650
No, you're not!

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.050
Your wounds are even worse then before.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.660
Last time I saw you your wounds healed already, but now...

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.180
That's because...

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.450
She's a Shikabane Hime.

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.490
She is connected to a specific person.

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:11.070
As long as that person is close to her...

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.950
...the Shikabane Hime can absorb his life energy...

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:19.920
...restore her body and even gain new skills or knowledge.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:24.210
We call such a person a 'Contracted Priest'.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:25.540
Bro!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.520
You don't look like you're doing alright.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.790
I told you not to come.

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.910
I had to.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.640
After all, I am your Contracted Priest.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.520
Get behind me.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.820
Scatter it to pieces with this.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.170
Bro?

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.360
Isn't this a nice song?

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.460
I know you wanted to stay and sing.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:35.360
But you can't sing like this now!

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.340
You want to live.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.630
You've got a strong will to keep on singing.

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:42.170
You refused to accept your fate.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.710
Now you've threw away your humanity,

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:46.750
you aren't able to touch people's hearts anymore.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.430
I can understand your suffering.

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:54.890
But your song is just a sad song full of death!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:01.430
Bro!

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:06.020
This is a plant grown in holy water.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.870
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.110
Makina.

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:15.270
The rest is up to you.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.530
The only one able to kill a Corpse is...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:18.770
The killer of the dead...

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.320
Born just for that purpose...

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.870
Only Shikabane Hime!

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:40.590
Bro?

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:41.680
Your wounds...

00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:30.370
Shikabane Hime is unable to kill human beings.

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:35.970
Even if that person is someone that murdered his own Shikabane Hime.

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.640
Even if that person is a betrayer priest.
